--- !u!114 &1545360342
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1545360340}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#FFC74C>\xBB</color>  <b>Runtime API:</b> shop.TryBuy(item) ->
    ShopPurchaseStatus; Buy / Select / IsOwned / CanAfford / GetPrice; SetRuntimePrice
    / ClearRuntimePrice; money.Add / Spend / CanSpend; events OnPurchasedId, OnPurchaseFailedId,
    OnSelectId, OnShopChanged.\n<color=#FFC74C>\xBB</color>  <b>Scene workflow:</b>
    Select 'Shop': its Shop Items are the cards in '[Demo] Frame/Content/Storefront
    Cards' and Auto Subscribe binds each price button to Buy. 'Money' is the wallet;
    the balance label is a TextMoney. Shop's string events and On Shop Changed call
    'Demo Controller'.\n<color=#FFC74C>\xBB</color>  <b>Verification:</b> Play: buy
    the cards - peperoni (free, equips at once), italian (25 coins), cheese (100
    coins). With too few coins a card turns Unaffordable and its button disables.
    Purchases and the balance persist between plays until Reset.\n<color=#FFC74C>\xBB</color> 
    Price button -> Shop.Buy (Auto Subscribe) -> Money.Spend\n<color=#FFC74C>\xBB</color> 
    +25 / +100 / Empty -> Money directly (NoCode persistent calls)\n<color=#FFC74C>\xBB</color> 
    TryBuy row -> ShopDemoController -> shop.TryBuy -> ShopPurchaseStatus\n<color=#FFC74C>\xBB</color> 
    ShopItem.OnSelectItem -> Equipped Glow.SetActive(true)"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
  m_fontMaterial: {fileID: 0}
  m_fontMaterials: []
